title: Microsoft Hyper-V Cluster: CSV IO of other nodes
agents: windows
catalog: os/storage
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the throughput, operations, latency and queue lengths
 of the cluster shared volumes (CSV) that are owned by other nodes of the cluster,
 as seen from the monitored node.

 Levels are configured with the rule "Disk IO levels".

 The data is collected by the agent plug-in {hyperv_host_csv_io.ps1}, which can
 be deployed with the agent bakery rule "Hyper-V".

item:
 The name of the cluster shared volume.

discovery:
 One service is created for each cluster shared volume owned by another node.
